    "summary": "On the tested 16-unit GLES path, adding a custom wave sampler overwrites the engine scene-depth binding at unit 9. A null field substitutes white depth and removes water. A zero field substitutes zero depth and restores water with an incorrect shore. Currents/cloud samplers can reach the same reserved units.",
